      <h2 class="chapter-title" id="pv-collect">What this site collects</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Nothing about you. It's literally a plain static site: plain HTML, CSS, and a little JavaScript for some interactive features. There are no forms, accounts or comments, and hell, not even a newsletter.</p>
      <p>The only thing I store is your theme choice, which lives in <code>localStorage</code>. Feel free to clear your site data and it's gone.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

