    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Hosting.</strong> It's just GitHub Pages, man. Whatever GitHub be doing, they do. See the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener" target="_blank">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Fonts.</strong> Typefaces are served from this site, not a CDN, so no third party sees you load them.</li>
        <li><strong>External links.</strong> Links to X (Twitter) or other sites are governed by those sites' own policies once you click on them.</li>
      </ul>
